{"id":"640740","name":"午餐肉拌西兰花侧芽","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/640740/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西兰花侧芽","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"红椒圈","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买的西兰花侧芽。","img":"images/640740/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把顶部嫩尖掰下来。","img":"images/640740/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/640740/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一小把切段，菜梗单独放。","img":"images/640740/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧水。","img":"images/640740/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烧水的同时取午餐肉。","img":"images/640740/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"午餐肉切条，蒜切末，红线椒切圈。","img":"images/640740/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放大碗里，加食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/640740/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放陈醋，拌匀。","img":"images/640740/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"水开先放菜梗煮开锅2分钟，再放菜叶，再煮开2分钟。","img":"images/640740/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"捞出过冷水放蒜末里。","img":"images/640740/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/640740/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放午餐肉和香油。","img":"images/640740/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/640740/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/640740/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}